        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-079454",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the home and community settings where we operate, patients with chronic conditions often require daily care, closely-managed medication regimens, and specialized clinical treatment, and our service model is defined by core pharmacy and provider services augmented by integrated care capabilities that are intended to maximize outcomes and minimize potential disruptions.",
        "start_character": 9162,
        "end_character": 9535
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-079454",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-079454-f8a34085c0a2d892",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-079454",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Market-leading scale with a focus on operational excellence and coordinated front-line care – We manage one of the nation’s largest independent platforms of both pharmacy and provider services offered on a daily basis in home and community settings – to address the multiple needs of medically complex Senior and Specialty patients.",
        "start_character": 6249,
        "end_character": 6581
      },
      {
